OAB - Mental health services struggle to keep up with growing demand. This study 
      explores how a RoBERTa large language model can help by analyzing text for signs 
      of anxiety or depression. It uses online therapy transcripts and forum posts, 
      learning to spot symptoms from what people write, even without tone or facial 
      cues. With accuracy similar to human experts, this approach shows promise for 
      making mental health evaluation more accessible and scalable.
