      Baek, Yong-seok Kim, Ye Won Jeon, Jiyoung Rhu, Su Hyun Lim, Hoon Choi, Se Jeong 
      Oh. Originally published in JMIR Medical Informatics 
      (https://medinform.jmir.org).
