TI  - Performance of a large language model for identifying central line-associated 
      bloodstream infections (CLABSI) using real clinical notes.
PG  - 1-4
LID - 10.1017/ice.2024.164 [doi]
AB  - We evaluated one of the first secure large language models approved for protected 
      health information, for identifying central line-associated bloodstream 
      infections (CLABSIs) using real clinical notes. Despite no pretraining, the model 
      demonstrated rapid assessment and high sensitivity for CLABSI identification. 
      Performance would improve with access to more patient data.
