DP  - 2023 May 18
TI  - Ontology-Based Semantic Annotation of French Psychiatric Clinical Documents.
PG  - 793-797
LID - 10.3233/SHTI230268 [doi]
AB  - Building a timeline of psychiatric patient profiles can answer many valuable 
      questions, such as how important medical events affect the progression of 
      psychosis in patients. However, the majority of text information extraction and 
      semantic annotation tools, as well as domain ontologies, are only available in 
      English and cannot be easily extended to other languages, due to fundamental 
      linguistic differences. In this paper, we describe a semantic annotation system 
      based on an ontology developed in the PsyCARE framework. Our system is being 
      manually evaluated by two annotators on 50 patient discharge summaries, showing 
      promising results.
