MH  - Humans
MH  - *Electronic Health Records
PMC - PMC9761741
OAB - Consolidation of electronic health record (EHR) databases can improve our 
      understanding of real-world patient journeys. A newly developed natural language 
      processing (NLP) pipeline can automatically extract outcome measures from EHR 
      databases and has potential for EHR data analysis for both clinical and research 
      purposes. Although an automated phenotyping algorithm has potential for 
      diagnosing patients with certain subtypes of rheumatoid arthritis using EHR data, 
      design choices (such as the definition of what key elements are used for 
      phenotyping) and missing data currently limit its clinical utility.
