      Chiara Zecca, Sebastian Walther, Katharina Stegmayer, Robert Hoepner, Milo Puhan, 
      Viktor von Wyl. Originally published in JMIR Medical Informatics 
      (https://medinform.jmir.org), 10.11.2022.
