      Viegas, Sergio Canuto, Washington Luiz, Sheila Ouriques Martins, Renata Vieira, 
      Carisi Polanczyk, Marcos André Gonçalves. Originally published in JMIR Medical 
      Informatics (https://medinform.jmir.org), 01.11.2021.
