      Rachael E Flatt, Marie-Laure Firebaugh, Corinna Jacobi, Andrea K Graham, Mark 
      Hoogendoorn, Denise E Wilfley, C Barr Taylor. Originally published in the Journal 
      of Medical Internet Research (http://www.jmir.org), 19.02.2020.
