TI  - Ontology-Driven Real World Evidence Extraction from Clinical Narratives.
PG  - 1441-1442
LID - 10.3233/SHTI190474 [doi]
AB  - Unstructured clinical notes contain a huge amount of information. We investigated 
      the possibility of harvesting such information through an NLP-based approach. A 
      manually curated ontology is the only resource required to handle all the steps 
      of the process leading from clinical narrative to a structured data warehouse 
      (i2b2). We have tested our approach at the Papa Giovanni XXIII hospital in 
      Bergamo (Italy) on pathology reports collected since 2008.
