TI  - How much does automatic text de-identification impact clinical problems, tests, 
      and treatments?
PG  - 177
AB  - Clinical text de-identification can potentially overlap with clinical information 
      such as medical problems or treatments, therefore causing this information to be 
      lost. In this study, we focused on the analysis of the overlap between the 2010 
      i2b2 NLP challenge concept annotations, with the PHI annotations of our 
      best-of-breed clinical text de-identification application. Overall, 0.81% of the 
      annotations overlapped exactly, and 1.78% partly overlapped.
