TI  - Medical i2b2 NLP smoking challenge: the A-Life system architecture and 
      methodology.
PG  - 40-3
AB  - We describe the architecture of LifeCode (A-Life Medical, Inc.), a natural 
      language processing system for free-text clinical information extraction, our 
      methodology in applying LifeCode to the i2b2 smoking challenge, and statistical 
      measures for performance evaluation. Due to the limited test size and the 
      coefficient of variation in the test standard, it is difficult to draw 
      conclusions regarding the relative efficacy of approaches that were applied to 
      this challenge.
