TI  - Concept negation in free text components of vaccine safety reports.
PG  - 1122
AB  - Large amounts of information are locked up in free text components of clinical 
      reports. Surveillance systems that monitor adverse events following immunizations 
      (AEFI) can utilize these components after concept extraction using natural 
      language processing (NLP). Specifically, our method for the identification and 
      filtering of negated concepts using the Unified Medical Language System (UMLS) 
      potentially improves the quality of AEFI surveillance systems.
